   "text": "Denied at Wall 2: 401 (bad token) or\n403 (missing scope); or HTTP 200 with\ndecision DENIED (missing_role,\nproject_not_in_token_roles). Logged as\nauth_failed, tool_denied or\nwall_violation_attempt; Sentinel\nABW-001 fires on the last.",
   "fontSize": 16,
