   "text": "Verifies the token again: signature\n(JWKS), audience, issuer, tenant,\nallowed client, scope Tools.Read. The\nrole must allow the tool and the project\n(falcon) must be in the token's roles.\nSwaps T2 for a Storage token (hop 4),\nthen reads the blob (hop 5).",
   "fontSize": 16,
   "fontFamily": 2,
