   "boundElements": [],
   "updated": 1735689600000,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "1. Prompt plus Wes's token T1 when sent through the APIM /agents front door (it validates\n    T1; diagram 11).\n2. tools/call get_deal_document {doc_id: FALCON-001} with Authorization: Bearer T2, the\n    user's own token that Foundry holds from the one-time consent.\n3. The same call and T2, unchanged, plus x-abw-request-id and x-abw-gateway: apim.\n4. Request to Entra: grant jwt-bearer, assertion T2, client_assertion T3, scope\n    https://storage.azure.com/user_impersonation. Response: T4.",
   "fontSize": 16,
   "fontFamily": 2,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "originalText": "1. Prompt plus Wes's token T1 when sent through the APIM /agents front door (it validates\n    T1; diagram 11).\n2. tools/call get_deal_document {doc_id: FALCON-001} with Authorization: Bearer T2, the\n    user's own token that Foundry holds from the one-time consent.\n3. The same call and T2, unchanged, plus x-abw-request-id and x-abw-gateway: apim.\n4. Request to Entra: grant jwt-bearer, assertion T2, client_assertion T3, scope\n    https://storage.azure.com/user_impersonation. Response: T4.",
   "autoResize": true,
   "lineHeight": 1.25
  },
  {
   "id": "d03_0151",
